AWS AI Practitioner – Generative AI & Amazon Bedrock
Overview

This document contains the transcripts and learning material for the first three videos in my AWS Certified AI Practitioner learning series.
The three videos are designed to build progressively from foundational concepts into practical implementation and real-world application of Generative AI using AWS services, with a primary focus on Amazon Bedrock.
The series begins by establishing the fundamental concepts behind Generative AI, foundation models, and Large Language Models. 
It then moves into practical interaction with Amazon Bedrock and foundation models before progressing into real-world applications, security, monitoring, evaluation, and best practices.
Together, these three videos provide a foundation for understanding how Generative AI solutions can be designed and implemented using AWS.

